- media: v4l2-ctrls-api: fix error handling for v4l2_g_ctrl()
  (bsc#1012628).
- media: v4l2-tpg: prevent the risk of a division by zero
  (bsc#1012628).
- media: vivid: fix buffer overwrite when using > 32 buffers
