- slcan: Don't transmit uninitialized stack data in padding
  (bnc#1012628).
- net: stmmac: dwmac1000: fix out-of-bounds mac address reg
  setting (bnc#1012628).
- net_sched: fix a missing refcnt in tcindex_init() (bnc#1012628).
