- hostap: Adjust indentation in prism2_hostapd_add_sta
  (bnc#1012628).
- iwlegacy: ensure loop counter addr does not wrap and cause an
  infinite loop (bnc#1012628).
- cifs: fix unitialized variable poential problem with network
