- rtlwifi: rtl8723ae: Fix missing break in switch statement
  (bnc#1012628).
- mwl8k: Fix rate_idx underflow (bnc#1012628).
- USB: serial: fix unthrottle races (bnc#1012628).
- virt: vbox: Sanity-check parameter types for hgcm-calls coming
