  (bnc#1012628).
- perf intel-pt: Fix overlap detection to identify consecutive
  buffers correctly (bnc#1012628).
- perf intel-pt: Fix sync_switch (bnc#1012628).
- perf intel-pt: Fix error recovery from missing TIP packet
  (bnc#1012628).
