- phy: work around 'phys' references to usb-nop-xceiv devices
  (bnc#1012628).
- ARM64: dts: marvell: armada-cp110: Fix clock resources for
  various node (bnc#1012628).
- ARM: sunxi_defconfig: Enable CMA (bnc#1012628).
